\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Six task scores across the retained checkpoints of the canonical chain (points) with 95\% item-bootstrap intervals (bars) and the base model's score as a dashed reference. Intervals for the base are not available. The panels share one 0--100 axis; Stage 3 (CSE) raises the SOC-style tasks and collapses canonical attribution and part of VSP, and Stage 4 recovers CKT and MMLU-Pro but neither attribution nor VSP.}}{18}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
